OL,3,GNEWSAI gave birth in ambulance on A96
OL,4,Aamid staff shortages at local hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman gave birth in an ambulance on
OL,7,Fthe A96 - after being told the
OL,8,Fspecialist care she might need was
OL,9,Funavailable at her local hospital.
OL,11,FHannah Smith, 39, was travelling to
OL,12,FAberdeen Maternity Hospital as she
OL,13,Fcould not go to Dr Gray's in Elgin -
OL,14,Fwhich is nearer - as its consultant-led
OL,15,Fmaternity services have been downgraded
OL,16,Fsince 2018.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
