OL,3,GNEWSAI gave birth in ambulance on A96
OL,4,Aamid staff shortages at local hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever her labour progressed so
OL,7,Fquickly during the journey that her
OL,8,Fbaby boy Braeson arrived before she
OL,9,Fcould get there. "I don't think anyone
OL,10,Fshould be put into that position," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FNHS Grampian said it was sorry about
OL,14,Fthe "poor experience".
